        93.79071807861328,
        527.390380859375,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "of 0.84 (95% CI: 0.75–0.90) and specificity of 0.37 (95% CI: 0.25–0.50) in this subpopulation. When",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
