        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.43994140625,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "performed sequentially after a positive W4SS among people living with HIV not on ART, CRP with a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
