      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.4300537109375,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "have significantly higher specificity (0.64; 95% CI: 0.55-0.72). Similar to the W4SS, the specificity of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.4146728515625,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "CRP for TB screening among inpatients living with HIV was found to be extremely low, likely due to",
