        474.24652099609375,
        527.507080078125,
        488.6895446777344
      ],
      "text": "As a point-of-care biomedical test, CRP represents an opportunity for enhancing TB screening among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97943115234375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
