    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        513.8464965820312,
        527.4511108398438,
        528.2894897460938
      ],
      "text": "detecting TB, however, will likely be reduced in settings with a lower TB prevalence than in those",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        527.04638671875,
        206.69412231445312,
        541.4893798828125
      ],
      "text": "included in the meta-analysis.",
