        70.86609649658203,
        551.549072265625,
        204.65536499023438,
        567.2810668945312
      ],
      "text": "3.3.1.3 Chest radiography",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        574.4888916015625,
        527.4244384765625,
        588.931884765625
      ],
      "text": "CXR is recommended by WHO to be used in parallel with the W4SS where CXR is available to assist",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        587.6890258789062,
        527.3067016601562,
        602.1320190429688
      ],
      "text": "in ruling out active TB prior to initiating TPT among people living with HIV who are on ART. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        600.8890380859375,
        527.279541015625,
        615.33203125
      ],
      "text": "GDG agreed that, due to the increased sensitivity, the evidence supported using CXR in addition",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        614.0889892578125,
        527.3729248046875,
        628.531982421875
      ],
      "text": "to the W4SS as a parallel screening strategy in which a positive or abnormal result on either screen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        627.2890014648438,
        527.3890991210938,
        641.7319946289062
      ],
      "text": "would indicate a referral for diagnostic evaluation. Data on “any abnormality” and an “abnormality",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        640.4888916015625,
        527.4452514648438,
        654.931884765625
      ],
      "text": "suggestive of TB” detected by CXR were reviewed and either approach is recommended, depending",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        653.6890258789062,
        527.4200439453125,
        668.1320190429688
      ],
      "text": "on the context, the availability of radiological expertise, resources and preference towards higher",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        666.8890380859375,
        210.5507049560547,
        681.33203125
      ],
      "text": "sensitivity or higher specificity.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        688.5928955078125,
        527.1212768554688,
        703.035888671875
      ],
      "text": "The evidence reviewed for the performance of CXR and the W4SS for all people living with HIV came",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995549201965332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
